        "evidence_id": "E13",
        "quote": "the OBR projects this could rise to 7.7% by the early 2070s"
      },
      {
        "tier": "projected",
        "claim": "The OBR has identified a 'ratchet effect' where the triple lock structurally raises pension spending as a share of GDP over time, particularly after economic shocks.",
        "evidence_id": "E10",
        "quote": "The OBR has highlighted a \"ratchet effect\" where the triple lock increases State Pension rates and spending as a proportion of GDP over time, especially following economic shocks, because increases are never fully unwound"
      },
      {
