        "claim": "Pension spending is projected to rise by around \u00a380 billion over the next 50 years, with over half attributed to the triple lock.",
        "evidence_id": "E12",
        "quote": "Spending on the State Pension is projected to rise by around \u00a380 billion over the next 50 years, with over half of this increase attributed to the triple lock"
      },
      {
